OL,3,GNEWSAEx-footballer Jermaine Pennant
OL,4,Aavoids driving ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Arsenal player Jermaine Pennant
OL,7,Fhas been spared a driving ban after he
OL,8,Fadmitted driving without insurance to
OL,9,Fpick up his partner, who had broken her
OL,10,Ffoot.
OL,12,FPennant was pulled over by the police
OL,13,Fwhile driving his Audi A5 S Line
OL,14,Fwithout insurance on the A406 eastbound
OL,15,Fon 2 September last year, Highbury
OL,16,FMagistrates' Court previously heard.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
