OL,3,GNEWSAEx-footballer Jermaine Pennant
OL,4,Aavoids driving ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 43-year-old ex-winger was handed a
OL,7,Fsix-month conditional discharge and
OL,8,Fordered to pay a #26 victim surcharge
OL,9,Fafter the judge found he had special
OL,10,Freasons as to why he should not be
OL,11,Fdisqualified.
OL,13,FThe six-month conditional discharge
OL,14,Fmeans the former footballer and pundit
OL,15,Fwill keep his licence provided he does
OL,16,Fnot commit any offences in that time.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
